  hearMoreName: EconomicHearMore03
  hearMoreText: "Sustainable processes keep both teams and budgets stable over time.
    True planning doesn\u2019t stop at release \u2014 it accounts for maintenance,
    updates, and user support throughout the software\u2019s lifecycle. By avoiding
    the trap of short-term savings, organizations can maintain steady progress and
    ensure the software remains reliable and cost-effective for years to come."
